<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · HARNESS 里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>圈住：让它只能碰该碰的</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 384, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 32px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>圈住</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 20, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56"}}>边界内</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 10}}>项目目录读写<br />构建与测试命令<br />本地依赖安装</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 20, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 14}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#A32D2D"}}>边界外</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 10}}>生产配置<br />凭据<br />任意外网地址</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 744, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 18}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>圈住：让它只能碰该碰的</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55}}>沙箱 + 权限：限定它碰得到的文件、连得到的网络、做得了的操作。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", marginTop: 8}}>你们本来就有一圈边界——现在把 agent 也圈进去。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>18 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
